/brand kit/

# Personal build narrative -- kept locally, not published
/docs/archive/story.md

# Local tool that recomputes stats (test count, maintenance pass count, ...)
# and writes them into <!--DYN:key-->...<!--/DYN--> markers across the
# tracked *.md files, so those numbers never sit hand-typed and drifting.
# The tool and its computed-values cache stay local, not the docs it edits.
/tools/docsync/
